  "correctValue": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Hypophosphoric acid&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f9eccd32-8ca2-4038-9e71-3f715fc3d3a2-9896189.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 220px;\" /></p><p>The oxidation state of phosphorus is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
